{
    "id": "create-usage-alert",
    "title": "Create a usage alert",
    "blocks": [
        {
            "type": "markdown",
            "content": "Use this interactive guide to create a **usage alert** in the **Cost Management and Billing** app. You'll set a budget on your total Grafana Cloud spend and choose where Grafana sends the notification, so you hear about cost changes before they show up on an invoice."
        },
        {
            "type": "section",
            "id": "open-alert-builder",
            "title": "Open the usage alert builder",
            "blocks": [
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "popout",
                    "targetvalue": "floating",
                    "content": "Pop this guide out into a floating window so it stays visible when the **Create new usage alerts** dialog opens."
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "navigate",
                    "reftarget": "/a/grafana-cmab-app",
                    "content": "Open the **Cost Management and Billing** app to manage your Grafana Cloud usage and spend.",
                    "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app"
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "navigate",
                    "reftarget": "/a/grafana-cmab-app/usage-alerts",
                    "content": "Go to the **Usage Alerts** tab to manage alerts on your Grafana Cloud usage and spend.",
                    "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/usage-alerts"
                },
                {
                    "type": "multistep",
                    "content": "Click **Create alert**, then select **All Products** to set a budget for your monthly organization spend.",
                    "requirements": [
                        "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/usage-alerts"
                    ],
                    "steps": [
                        {
                            "action": "highlight",
                            "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"cmab-create-alert-menu-button\"]",
                            "requirements": [
                                "exists-reftarget",
                                "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/usage-alerts"
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "action": "highlight",
                            "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"cmab-alert-menu-product-global-spend\"]",
                            "requirements": [
                                "exists-reftarget",
                                "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/usage-alerts"
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "markdown",
            "content": "The global-spend alert builder is open; set your monthly budget and notification options."
        },
        {
            "type": "section",
            "id": "configure-alert",
            "title": "Configure and create your alert",
            "blocks": [
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "highlight",
                    "reftarget": "label:contains('Global usage')",
                    "content": "Keep **Global usage** selected to alert on your total Grafana Cloud spend. You can also choose attributed stack usage or anomaly detection.",
                    "requirements": [
                        "exists-reftarget",
                        "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/usage-alerts"
                    ],
                    "doIt": false
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "highlight",
                    "reftarget": "#product-selector",
                    "content": "Leave **Product** set to **Global spend** for a budget alert. Alternatively, you can pick a specific product instead to alert on that product's usage.",
                    "requirements": [
                        "exists-reftarget",
                        "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/usage-alerts"
                    ],
                    "doIt": false
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "formfill",
                    "reftarget": "#threshold-input-global-spend",
                    "targetvalue": "1000",
                    "content": "Enter your monthly budget in dollars, for example `1000`. Grafana alerts you as your spend approaches this amount.",
                    "requirements": [
                        "exists-reftarget",
                        "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/usage-alerts"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "markdown",
                    "content": "Alert levels decide how close to the budget you get notified. Select one or more preset levels (for example 50%, 70%, 85%, and 95% of the threshold), or add a custom level to fine-tune when Grafana warns you."
                },
                {
                    "type": "interactive",
                    "action": "highlight",
                    "reftarget": "#contact-point-selector",
                    "content": "Choose a **Contact point** for the notification. If none are available, create one before saving your alert.",
                    "requirements": [
                        "exists-reftarget",
                        "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/usage-alerts"
                    ],
                    "doIt": false,
                    "skippable": true
                },
                {
                    "type": "markdown",
                    "content": "Review your settings, then click **Create alerts** to start monitoring."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "markdown",
            "content": "Your budget configuration is prepared. Review the alert levels, choose a contact point, and click **Create alerts** when you are ready to enable notifications."
        }
    ]
}
